<title>LUXEMBOURG: Luxembourg Treasury sets new linear bond auction.</title>
<headline>Luxembourg Treasury sets new linear bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Luxembourg Treasury announced the following OLUX auction:</p>
<p>    Auction date:		 May 21</p>
<p>    Linear bond:		  5.50%, 23/05/97-2007</p>
<p>    Series nr:		    1</p>
<p>    ISIN code:		    LU-007639473-2</p>
<p>    Common code:		  7639473</p>
<p>    Payment date:		 May 23</p>
<p>NOTE - previous auction Oct 16, 1996, avge weighted yld 5.916%, first time OLUX traded through Bunds since 1950s.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
